#
# Default-deny Docker build context for:
#   cargo build/clippy --locked --features cuda
# and documented:
#   docker run --gpus all … cargo test --locked --features cuda [-- --ignored]
#
# Prevents host credentials (actions-runner, .env, keys) and build junk
# from being sent via `COPY . .`.

# Deny everything first
*

# Required crate inputs
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!build.rs
!src
!src/**
!cu
!cu/**
!tests
!tests/**

# Declared [[example]] in Cargo.toml — required for cargo parse / bench example
!examples
!examples/**

# Optional docs/license (harmless; useful for image inspection)
!LICENSE-MIT
!LICENSE-APACHE
!README.md

# ── Re-deny after recursive allows (order matters in .dockerignore) ──────────
# Secrets that might sit under allowlisted trees
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/.credentials
**/.credentials_rsaparams

# Generated device artifacts under cu/ (sources only)
cu/**/*.ptx
cu/**/*.cubin
**/*.ptx
**/*.cubin
